OL,3,ATrump backs return of ex-Nvidia boss
OL,4,Aafter 'Bring Jensen Back' campaign
OL,5,Alaunched
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,8,F"would certainly not mind" seeing
OL,9,FJensen Huang handed back his job as
OL,10,Fallies of the former Nvidia chief
OL,11,Fexecutive called for him to be
OL,12,Freinstated.
OL,14,FHuang resigned as boss of the AI chip
OL,15,Fgiant last week after the emergence of
OL,16,Ftwo affairs, one of which was with a
OL,17,Fwoman suspected of spying for China and
OL,18,Fanother allegedly with one of his
OL,19,Femployees.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
