OL,3,ATrump backs return of ex-Nvidia boss
OL,4,Aafter 'Bring Jensen Back' campaign
OL,5,Alaunched
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt created a crisis for one of the
OL,8,Fworld's most valuable firms, which is a
OL,9,Fkey part of the AI rollout, but the BBC
OL,10,Fhas been told Nvidia's board is not
OL,11,Fconsidering reinstating Huang.
OL,13,FMeanwhile the Trump administration on
OL,14,FMonday said it will further restrict
OL,15,FChina's b@Kaccess to AI chips from
OL,16,Fcompanies like Nvidia.
